<title>USA: Winnebago sets bi-annual $0.10/shr payout.</title>
<headline>Winnebago sets bi-annual $0.10/shr payout.</headline>
<dateline>FOREST CITY, Iowa 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Winnebago Industries Inc said Thursday its board intends to pay bi-annual cash dividends of $0.10 per share in January and July.</p>
<p>A cash dividend will be paid January 6, 1997 to holders of record as of December 6, 1996.</p>
<p>The motor home manufacturer, which previously had no formally structured dividend policy, paid a total of $0.30 per share in fiscal 1996. Its last dividend was $0.10 per share.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
